#format http://ns.nuke24.net/TEF/Formats/SyntaxV0.3

=namespace tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:
short-description: general terms, possibly to be replaced by something from dublin core as we get things sorted out

=type tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:Category
short-description: a general category record

=type tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:Standard
short-description: a standard or specification record

=type tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:Format
short-description: a data format

=type tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:ProjectBase
short-description: a project base record

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:sha256
short-description: SHA-256 of the resource, which must be or have a canonical representation as a byte sequence

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:byteLength
short-description: length of the resource, in bytes

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:filename
short-description: the file name recorded alongside a file reference

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:name
short-description: a short name

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:title
short-description: a human-readable title

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:shortDescription
short-description: a one-line description

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:tag
short-description: a tag or label

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:keyword
short-description: a keyword

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:isMemberOf
short-description: a set or category that a resource belongs to

Also used to indicate that an object meets some specification, or is [somewhat vaguely] of a type.
The 'type' usage has some overlap with http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type,
so we should probably, at some point, come up with guidelines for when to use which,
and update source documents accordingly.

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:memberOf
short-description: deprecated alias for isMemberOf

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:member
short-description: a member of a set

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:seeAlso
short-description: a related resource

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:obsoletedBy
short-description: a resource that replaces this one

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:file
short-description: a file associated with a resource

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:image
short-description: an image associated with a resource

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:photo
short-description: a photograph associated with a resource

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:isDocumentedBy
short-description: a documentation resource associated with a resource

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:demo
short-description: a demonstration resource associated with a resource

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:mirror
short-description: a mirror of a resource

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:alias
short-description: an alternative identifier or location

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:created
short-description: a creation date or date description

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:source
short-description: a source reference for a resource

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:projectHomepage
short-description: the home page of a project

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:general:subformatOf
short-description: a format of which this format is a subformat


=namespace tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:3dparts:
short-description: terms that are specific to 3D-printable shapes ('parts')

=type tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:3dparts:Part
short-description: a 3D-printable part

=type tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:3dparts:PartCategory
short-description: a category of parts

=type tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:3dparts:PartSet
short-description: a named set of parts

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:3dparts:stlFile
short-description: an STL model file of the part

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:3dparts:csgFile
short-description: a CSG model file representing the part

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:3dparts:openscadRendering
short-description: a rendering of the part produced from an OpenSCAD model

=attribute tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:3dparts:openscadDesign
short-description: the OpenSCAD design source used to generate the part


=namespace tag:nuke24.net,2026-11:wsitem:
short-description: terms about physical objects
